{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38976","headline":"寄温州朱尚书幷呈军倅崔太傅 · 杜荀鹤","name":"寄温州朱尚书幷呈军倅崔太傅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"永嘉名郡昔推名，连属荀家弟与兄。\n教化静师龚渤海，篇章高体谢宣城。\n山从海岸妆吟景，水自城根演政声。\n今日老输崔博士，不妨疎逸伴双旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}